WEBVTT

00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:08,220
Hello everybody, this is Dr. Kevin Cutters and we are going to be talking about the question

00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:10,460
I'm doing chemotherapy or not.

00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:17,420
When you get a diagnosis of cancer, it can be scary and it's easy to get pressured into

00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:21,020
something that maybe you're not ready to do.

00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:25,620
So if you're certainly ready to do it, have peace about chemotherapy by all means that you

00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:28,940
just need to do what you think is best for your body.

00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:31,900
But that's not what this little talk is for.

00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:36,460
