00:02:58,660 --> 00:03:01,780
on a natural approach and she didn't really quite well.

00:03:01,780 --> 00:03:07,700
So rule number one, just slow down a little bit.

00:03:07,700 --> 00:03:14,900
And then rule number two, don't follow another's dogma.

00:03:14,900 --> 00:03:22,060
I've said over and over again in many videos, in my book, you don't want to be dogmatic

00:03:22,060 --> 00:03:26,500
about your health care, meaning that you don't want to be just stuck.

00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:33,660
I'm only going to do an alternative approach and you're not going to have at least have

00:03:33,660 --> 00:03:41,660
your open up your eyes to maybe chemo, maybe radiation, maybe surgery is in your best interest

00:03:41,660 --> 00:03:43,460
as well.

