Well, I'm sure most oncologists only want the best for their patients, but the truth is

00:04:04,140 --> 00:04:10,100
they have three tools in their tool bank just because everybody else did it.

00:04:10,100 --> 00:04:16,540
Grandma and your sister and your aunt did chemotherapy does not mean it's right for you.

00:04:16,540 --> 00:04:23,020
So slow down a little bit back to rule one and don't do something just because everyone

00:04:23,020 --> 00:04:25,660
else is doing it.

00:04:25,660 --> 00:04:30,100
Don't need to follow another person's dogma, slow down a little bit.

00:04:30,100 --> 00:04:38,740
Rule number three, you have to be your own doctor, especially in today's health care conundrum

00:04:38,740 --> 00:04:44,180
that's out there, you have got to take control of your life and be your own doctor.

00:04:44,180 --> 00:04:51,300
