00:04:51,300 --> 00:04:58,220
your oncologist, your car partner, your antropath, whoever it is, you have to be your own doctor.

00:04:58,220 --> 00:05:03,900
You have to take charge of your body and you want your doctor to be your coach, your doctor

00:05:03,900 --> 00:05:08,620
to be your leader, your doctor to be part of your team.

00:05:08,620 --> 00:05:13,020
You're going to have multiple doctors be part of your team, but you have to ultimately

