be the maybe switch metaphors, the general contractor of your of your construction of your body

00:05:19,860 --> 00:05:20,860
here.

00:05:20,860 --> 00:05:24,620
So make sure you take charge and be your own doctor.

00:05:24,620 --> 00:05:29,500
