00:05:36,900 --> 00:05:37,740
Now be careful.

00:05:37,740 --> 00:05:43,620
There's a balance here, you don't want every person that is in your church coming up and

00:05:43,620 --> 00:05:50,500
telling you what to do, but there is a wisdom in a multitude of counselors, good, solid people

